    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## FANA 01 - Lead Intake & CRM Sync\n3 channel webhooks -> one schema via Core Engine. Idempotency: event_key checked first, recorded only AFTER HubSpot succeeds. Dedupe key: auction + E.164 mobile (else email). Contact search: phone OR email OR fana_lead_key.",
